\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Scalar positivity and the remaining extensions}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{The reflection inequality of \ref{fdip-00FP} and the cylinder
inequality of \ref{fdip-00FS} concern the scalar arc field.
\ref{fdip-00DY} records the 1975 correction to the first
reconstruction paper and the linear growth bound used for the
remaining Schwinger functions. \ref{fdip-007R} keeps the gauge
and fermion questions, together with continuous groups as
limits, outside the scalar calculation. The covariance agreement of \ref{fdip-00FT} stays inside this
scalar setting.}
